[2026-09-14T11:46:09.513] Cog0  BD-NOTE,DIFF: that exclusion is required because the library's own output line count varies with its own verdict
[2026-09-14T11:46:09.515] Cog0  BD-NOTE,DIFF: logs from different build variants are not comparable -- compare a default-build log only against another default-build log
[2026-09-14T11:46:09.516] Cog0  BD-NOTE,LIBVRD: a bare abort returns 0 and is indistinguishable from a completed call so ABORT appears only for a valued abort
[2026-09-14T11:46:09.517] Cog0  BD-NOTE,LIBVRD: ground truth for an abort is the library's own ! ERROR: line inside the BD-LIB bracket
[2026-09-14T11:46:09.518] Cog0  BD-NOTE,UNREACHABLE: cold-after-a-cog-has-run is impossible in one power cycle by definition -- that is why every cog NONE cell is phase 1
[2026-09-14T11:46:09.519] Cog0  BD-NOTE,UNREACHABLE: and it is why phase 2 can never be re-run without a reset
[2026-09-14T11:46:09.520] Cog0  BD-NOTE,UNREACHABLE: cogst RUNNING is measured only on the cog's OWN group because the cog's effect is per-pin
